1
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:12,000
Jason is ready for adulthood. His grandpa isn't.

2
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Dirty Grandpa is a comedy film directed by Dan Mazer.

3
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:24,000
Jason Kelly is one week away from marrying his boss's uber-controlling daughter,
putting him on the fast track for a partnership at the law firm.

4
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:30,000
However, when the straight-laced Jason is tricked into driving his foul-mouthed grandfather,
Dick, to Daytona for spring break, his pending nuptials are suddenly in jeopardy.

5
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:36,000
Between riotous frat parties, bar fights, and an epic night of karaoke, Dick is on a
quest to live his life to the fullest and bring Jason along for the ride.

6
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:42,000
Dick Kelly, played by Robert De Niro.

7
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:48,000
Jason Kelly, played by Zac Efron.

8
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:54,000
Lenore, played by Aubrey Plaza.

9
00:45:54,000 --> 00:46:00,000
Shadia, played by Zoey Deutch.

10
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
Meredith Goldstein, played by Julianne Hough.

11
00:56:06,000 --> 00:56:12,000
David Kelly, played by Dermot Mulroney.

12
01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:18,000
Dirty Grandpa is a 2016 American comedy film about a lawyer who
drives his grandfather to Florida during spring break.

13
01:06:18,000 --> 01:06:24,000
The film was directed by Dan Mazer and written by John Phillips.

14
01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:30,000
It stars Robert De Niro and Zac Efron in the leading roles, with Aubrey Plaza,
Zoey Deutch, Julianne Hough and Dermot Mulroney in supporting roles.

15
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
It was filmed on location in Atlanta from January 19 to May 9, 2015.

16
01:21:36,000 --> 01:21:42,000
The film was theatrically released on January 22, 2016, by Lionsgate.

17
01:26:42,000 --> 01:26:48,000
It grossed $105 million worldwide, and was panned by critics, several
of whom called it the worst film they had ever seen.

18
01:31:48,000 --> 01:31:54,000
The film explores themes of funeral, golf, grandfather, road trip, crude humor.

19
01:36:54,000 --> 01:37:00,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
